            "notes": "<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-476109\" src=\"https://assets.rockpapershotgun.com/images//2017/09/bramblelash1-620x310.jpg\" alt=\"BrambleLash\" width=\"620\" height=\"310\" /></p>\n<p>A couple of years after it <a href=\"https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/2015/04/02/bramblelash/\">popped into our ModDB-related consciousness</a> the local multiplayer co-op prickle &#8217;em up, <a href=\"https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/tag/bramblelash/\">BrambleLash</a> [<a href=\"http://www.bytespritegames.com/\">official site</a>] is coming out <a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/453220/BrambleLash/\">on Steam</a> on 13 September. It&#8217;s come a long way since the 2014 Global Game Jam which spawned the idea: <a href=\"https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/2017/09/11/bramblelash-launch-date/#more-476085\" class=\"more-link\">(more&hellip;)</a></p>\n"
